    "RetryConfigSchema": {
      "description": "Retry configuration for call scheduling.\n\nDefault value is None (no retries).\nTo enable retries, set both fields:\n- max_retry_count: 0-10 (number of retry attempts, 0 means no retries)\n- retry_interval_hours: 0-24 (hours between retries, 0 means no retries)\n\nAt organization storage level, None means unset (runtime applies 0, 0).",
